                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-8" aria-label="Return from footnote 8.">Return to 8</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-9">McCord, Roisin, and Edward Simpson Prescott. 2014. &ldquo;<a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://ideas.repec.org/a/fip/fedreq/00014.html" target="_blank">The Financial Crisis, the Collapse of Bank Entry, and Changes in the Size Distribution of Banks</a>,&rdquo; <em><a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://ideas.repec.org/s/fip/fedreq.html" target="_blank">Economic Quarterly</a></em>, Federal Reserve Bank of Richmond, issue 1Q, pgs. 23&ndash;50.
